      "jp": "主人公たちはリュミヴェルと共に、\n森の奥へと足を踏み入れていた。",
      "jp_sha256": "9e7462549a97d636e03eb4ca6b5fdee277b34966c1b99120a70f343729ea539e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "주인공 일행은 류미베르와 함께\n숲 안쪽으로 발을 들이고 있었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 8,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bb75ff9083983da2a48157c3e657c67d134be75d59cdba1cb8e2f62ce9af674f:000000_-4805568655391499956:g0:r7",
      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "主人公たちはリュミヴェルと共に、\n森の奥へと足を踏み入れていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "739eda2928a0c330d2caf2c93aeaf7558cac34568fb6507e2207db34ef34f9aa",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "――えっと、情報を整理させてくださいね。\nつまり、リュミヴェルさんは喧嘩した腹いせに、\n恋の媚薬をオプスカリテさんに塗った、と。",
      "jp_sha256": "d652b2cd697bf266033eaccaec0b03a602ed68f17707941477e87eac2a9daa38",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "――저기, 정보를 정리해 볼게요.\n그러니까 류미베르 씨는 싸운 것에 앙심을 품고\n옵스카리테 씨에게 사랑의 미약을 발랐고요.",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bb75ff9083983da2a48157c3e657c67d134be75d59cdba1cb8e2f62ce9af674f:000000_-4805568655391499956:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "――えっと、情報を整理させてくださいね。\nつまり、リュミヴェルさんは喧嘩した腹いせに、\n恋の媚薬をオプスカリテさんに塗った、と。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "d7c245558663c2607974bd89b02c4b076528a713edce62ebbda3177bbb2f0ed3",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "で、その後、寝ていたはずのオプスカリテさんが目覚めると、\nたまたま空を散歩していた、スズさんを見つけて\n恋に堕ちてしまい、追いかけていった……と。",
      "jp_sha256": "7b65a7fc1ebb39699d23b839f2de641f0bd56b633095e1a19f23c5f07406fd12",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그 뒤 자고 있던 옵스카리테 씨가 깨어나자\n마침 하늘을 산책하던 스즈 씨를 발견해\n사랑에 빠지고 뒤쫓아 갔다……는 거죠.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bb75ff9083983da2a48157c3e657c67d134be75d59cdba1cb8e2f62ce9af674f:000000_-4805568655391499956:g0:r9",
      "row_index_0based": 9,
      "serialized_row_index": 9,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "で、その後、寝ていたはずのオプスカリテさんが目覚めると、\nたまたま空を散歩していた、スズさんを見つけて\n恋に堕ちてしまい、追いかけていった……と。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "49681adfe850e92e6f21f0e04754df9db6e24288040c04257e9299b6642ebf2c",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "その通りですぞよ。恐らくスズさんは、\nオプスカリテさんと一緒にいるはずですぞよ。",
      "jp_sha256": "718470adbc65ce0d60d467dcfcf16ee595945fa56d5932fee0a02ca44bea98ad",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그 말대로이니라. 아마 스즈 씨는\n옵스카리테 씨와 함께 있을 것이니라.",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bb75ff9083983da2a48157c3e657c67d134be75d59cdba1cb8e2f62ce9af674f:000000_-4805568655391499956:g0:r10",
      "row_index_0based": 10,
      "serialized_row_index": 10,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "リュミヴェル",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "その通りですぞよ。恐らくスズさんは、\nオプスカリテさんと一緒にいるはずですぞよ。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "リュミヴェル",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "651940bf1ed465534664efca64f887fb861fb9275a88330c0b9b15145af325d1",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "スズの居場所はまあ見当がついたとして、\nそのピクシー娘はどうして、\nご主人の瞼に恋の媚薬を塗ったりしたんだ？",
      "jp_sha256": "0d6997a04ce927326a914f21cc007fd33fff7fa7a48ad8910e0ab8202c18fde6",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "스즈가 어디 있는지는 대충 짐작이 간다 치고\n그 픽시 소녀는 왜\n주인님 눈꺼풀에 사랑의 미약을 바른 거야?",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 15,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bb75ff9083983da2a48157c3e657c67d134be75d59cdba1cb8e2f62ce9af674f:000000_-4805568655391499956:g0:r14",
      "row_index_0based": 14,
      "serialized_row_index": 14,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "セレン",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_右中前",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "スズの居場所はまあ見当がついたとして、\nそのピクシー娘はどうして、\nご主人の瞼に恋の媚薬を塗ったりしたんだ？",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "セレン",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "2cd2ed76e3cdbe73f1626d7466c8b4779249b36ff4d2b0a4019b5a4ee5d1574a",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 5,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "それは私にもわからないのですぞよ。\nだから解毒薬をもらうため、ピクシー娘を探していたのですが、\n何やら焦って逃げられてしまいましたですぞよ。",
      "jp_sha256": "3bac401d617c550c318ea578e41447e9ea7880086b92c8ef3947ba86bcabfcb9",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그건 나도 모르느니라.\n그래서 해독약을 받으려고 픽시 소녀를 찾고 있었는데\n왠지 다급하게 도망가 버렸느니라.",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 16,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bb75ff9083983da2a48157c3e657c67d134be75d59cdba1cb8e2f62ce9af674f:000000_-4805568655391499956:g0:r15",
      "row_index_0based": 15,
      "serialized_row_index": 15,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "リュミヴェル",
        "Emt7_Ama",
        "layer_左中奥",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "それは私にもわからないのですぞよ。\nだから解毒薬をもらうため、ピクシー娘を探していたのですが、\n何やら焦って逃げられてしまいましたですぞよ。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "リュミヴェル",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
