    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "3d1beddf522e16894a0a74dd9265adc45b86a0cdbae88838b3d0aac8aca0928a",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 6,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "まあ、その事情とやらはあとで問い詰めるとして、\nリュミヴェル……あなた、またやらかしたのですか。",
      "jp_sha256": "ce4b22639f9d4adea30476518294c4d240a7453b1cb9bc29eb6c4e71deb086e7",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "뭐, 그 사정이라는 건 나중에 추궁하기로 하고\n류미베르…… 당신 또 사고 쳤습니까.",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 19,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bb75ff9083983da2a48157c3e657c67d134be75d59cdba1cb8e2f62ce9af674f:000000_-4805568655391499956:g0:r18",
      "row_index_0based": 18,
      "serialized_row_index": 18,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ビビ神",
        "Emt1_Nor",
        "layer_ビビ神c_右",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "まあ、その事情とやらはあとで問い詰めるとして、\nリュミヴェル……あなた、またやらかしたのですか。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ビビ神",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "5f61c742243cf65c01a8e6119ff1e3ff32de456cdb11c51f1fb16574cfdd1508",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "こ、今回は塗った後に「やべ、やらかした」と思って、\nすぐに解毒しようとしたのですぞよ。\nでも、解毒する前にオプスカリテさんが起きてしまい……。",
      "jp_sha256": "e5db41e1b6cb56dfd32efd02ea9d442e596d5209e86a461423586df88c0b0b0b",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "이, 이번에는 바른 뒤에 「큰일, 사고 쳤다」고 생각해서\n바로 해독하려 했느니라.\n하지만 해독하기 전에 옵스카리테 씨가 깨어 버려서…….",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 20,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b015-20261109-3b84ed832b75",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bb75ff9083983da2a48157c3e657c67d134be75d59cdba1cb8e2f62ce9af674f:000000_-4805568655391499956:g0:r19",
      "row_index_0based": 19,
      "serialized_row_index": 19,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "リュミヴェル",
        "Emt5_Sca",
        "layer_左中奥",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "こ、今回は塗った後に「やべ、やらかした」と思って、\nすぐに解毒しようとしたのですぞよ。\nでも、解毒する前にオプスカリテさんが起きてしまい……。",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "リュミヴェル",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "aa796594a547be3f7f475e1f620baa1dffdb2a25062ecf7cdadfa7758ca879cd",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "えっと、リュミヴェルさんとオプスカリテさんに、\n昔なにかあったんですか？",
