      "row_index_0based": 20,
      "serialized_row_index": 20,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "えっと、リュミヴェルさんとオプスカリテさんに、\n昔なにかあったんですか？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "e4be715ef9a1d72f2dfeab015c8d7be34d89c23a6da5652d02611c00f94f075f",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "それは内緒なのですぞよ。\nさあ、到着ですぞよ。この辺りからピクシー娘の気配が――。",
